{
  "scriptId": "PASTE_YOUR_SCRIPT_ID_HERE",
  "rootDir": "./backend"
}

// NOTE — this file is a template. Do not edit it with real values.
//
//   1. Copy it:   cp .clasp.json.example .clasp.json
//   2. Open .clasp.json and replace PASTE_YOUR_SCRIPT_ID_HERE with the real
//      Script ID.
//
// Where to find the Script ID: open the Google Sheet, choose
// Extensions -> Apps Script, then Project Settings (gear icon). The Script ID
// is on that page. It is a long string of letters, digits, - and _.
//
// rootDir must stay "./backend" — that is the folder clasp pushes to Apps
// Script. Nothing outside backend/ is ever uploaded.
//
// .clasp.json itself is in .gitignore, because the script ID is specific to
// one deployment and TEST and PROD have different ones. This .example file is
// what gets committed.
//
// Strip these comment lines out of your real .clasp.json — clasp expects
// plain JSON.
